{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果公司於10月23日迎來了初代iPod發佈25周年紀念日。作為蘋果歷史上最具影響力的產品之一，iPod不僅徹底改變了數碼音樂市場，也幫助蘋果成功突破Mac電腦業務的局限，為後來iPhone等產品的誕生奠定了基礎。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1583556.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:48.981148+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":112,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.769406+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:02.769406+00:00","content_hash":"1aa5fac86ab37b6eda4d85c968e097d5f0d4a5d0a54d221267baa807da2085dc","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}